      "y": 304,
      "width": 374,
      "height": 336,
      "text": "Client → Server (WebSocket):\n{type:\"op\", docId:\"abc\", revision:42,\n op:{type:\"insert\",pos:5,text:\"hello\"}}\n\nServer → All Clients (broadcast):\n{type:\"ack\", revision:43,\n op:{type:\"insert\",pos:5,text:\"hello\"},\n transformedFrom:42}\n\n1. Client sends op + its current revision\n2. OT transforms against concurrent ops\n3. Server acks new revision, broadcasts",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
